rows.text:
A cue requires actual completed current observer-safe evidence and its own admission;
permission or old identity alone cannot create it. Cue admission is read-only and creates
no memory, formation source, learning transition, physiological access, presentation or
reinforcement. Numeric zero remains evidence. Safe signal identity and bounded provenance
do not include physical truth or raw-sample resolvers. Reuse the actual opportunity;
a distinct recall evaluation is not a new sensory occurrence.
